        <mxCell id="tier_app" value="application Tier | 10.82.48.0/20 (Private Subnets)&#10;• VPC Interface Endpoints: execute-api, cognito-idp&#10;• Security Group CL-APP-01: Inbound TCP 443 from cc-staff, cc-logistics, cc-ground-stations [AUDIT]&#10;• CL-APP-02: Endpoint policy restricted to platform API ARNs [AUDIT]" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#eff6ff;strokeColor=#3b82f6;strokeWidth=1.5;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=6;spacingLeft=8;fontColor=#1e3a8a;fontSize=11;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1750" y="675" width="390" height="115" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="tier_storage" value="object_storage Tier | 10.82.80.0/20 (Private Subnets)&#10;• VPC Interface Endpoint: Amazon S3 (com.amazonaws.us-east-1.s3)&#10;• Security Group CL-DRN-01: Inbound TCP 443 from cc-ground-stations only [AUDIT]&#10;• CL-DRN-02: Policy: s3:PutObject &amp;amp; AbortMultipart on drone bucket [AUDIT]" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#eff6ff;strokeColor=#3b82f6;strokeWidth=1.5;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=6;spacingLeft=8;fontColor=#1e3a8a;fontSize=11;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1750" y="805" width="390" height="105" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="tier_admin" value="administration Tier | 10.82.96.0/20 (Private Subnets)&#10;• Route 53 Resolver Inbound Endpoint (2 IP addresses, CL-ADM-01, UDP/TCP 53) [AUDIT]&#10;• Endpoints: CloudWatch Logs, CloudWatch, IAM Roles Anywhere (CL-ADM-02) [AUDIT]&#10;• Management Session Host: outbound SSH 22 &amp;amp; HTTPS 443 to cc-device-mgmt (CL-ADM-03)" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#eff6ff;strokeColor=#3b82f6;strokeWidth=1.5;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=6;spacingLeft=8;fontColor=#1e3a8a;fontSize=11;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1750" y="925" width="390" height="115" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="cloud_defense_box" value="CLOUD DEFENSE &amp;amp; OBSERVABILITY CONTROLS&#10;• CL-EGR-01: No NAT GW &amp;amp; no default internet route [AUDIT]&#10;• CL-DEF-01: Explicit Default Deny on SGs, NACLs &amp;amp; TGW [AUDIT]&#10;• CL-DEF-02: Flow logs to CloudWatch with 'logs' key [REVIEW]&#10;• CL-ADM-05: Config rules block open mgmt ports [AUDIT]" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fef2f2;strokeColor=#ef4444;strokeWidth=1.5;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=6;spacingLeft=8;fontColor=#991b1b;fontSize=11;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1">
