        <mxCell id="tier_data" value="data Tier | 10.82.64.0/20 (Private Subnets)&#10;• Amazon DynamoDB &amp;amp; S3 Gateway Endpoints (CL-DAT-03 with aws:ResourceOrgID) [REVIEW]&#10;• Stateless NACL CL-DAT-01: DENY ALL from 10.40.0.0/13 (Lowest rule number) [AUDIT]&#10;• Security Group CL-DAT-02: ALLOW Store Port from App Tier only; rest DENY [REVIEW]" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#eff6ff;strokeColor=#3b82f6;strokeWidth=1.5;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=6;spacingLeft=8;fontColor=#1e3a8a;fontSize=11;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1">
