        <mxCell id="tier_drone_reserved" value="drone_object_ingress Tier | 10.82.32.0/20 (Private Subnets)&#10;[RESERVED TIER - NO ENDPOINTS DEPLOYED IN PILOT (ASM-140, closes PD-121)]&#10;• Ground station endpoints sit in application and object_storage tiers&#10;• CC-DRN-02: Inbound traffic from centers explicitly DENIED [AUDIT]" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fef2f2;strokeColor=#ef4444;strokeWidth=1.5;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=6;spacingLeft=8;fontColor=#991b1b;fontSize=11;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1">
